                /** @description Registry key = gateway path segment = worktree dir name = pidfile/log suffix. Reserved names (`qdrant elasticsearch neo4j postgres redis embedding crossencoder faiss tenants manifest default public admin services health ragstack api ui gowe vaxpipe grafana sfr ctl`) are refused by `paths.ValidateName`, not by this pattern. */
